        <elementInformation name="description" show="1">gateway/backup; komunikacija: 2x FE (RJ45), RS485 (rezervirano), DI1 (bypass), DI2 (ATS), DO1 (omrežni kontaktor), DO2 (kontaktor agregata), DO3 (2-žilni zagon agregata)</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="notes" show="1">Viri: Datasheet - Sigen Energy Gateway HomeMax TP (Preliminary, 2024), Sigenergy - uradni CDN str. 2; Datasheet Sigen Energy Gateway HomeMax SP 12K / HomeMax TP (nizozemski, uradna predloga Sigenergy) - VIR PRODAJALEC: gostuje GPC Europe (res.cloudinary.com), ker ga Sigenergy Download Center nima str. 1; Sigen Gateway HomeMax TP Installation Guide, v04 (2025-08-19); iz ZIP Sigen Gateway HomeMax TP Installer Manual_EN.zip str. 2 (Port Description), 3 (notranjost), 5 (kabli), 14-15 (komunikacija, 2 izvedbi), 17 (vklop); Sigen Energy Gateway Home Series User Manual, v08 (2026-06-05) str. 25-27 (HomePro SP), 33-35 (HomeMax SP), 36-38 (HomeMax SP 12K), 55-57 (HomePro TP), 59-61 (HomeMax TP) - risbe mer; Application Note - How to connect the Generator to Sigen Energy Gateway</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="mass_kg" show="1">23</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="width" show="1">510</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="height" show="1">750</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="depth" show="1">179</elementInformation>
    </elementInformations>
